            Please note, it is our program requirement that all Lawyers insured by ISBA Mutual Company must be current members of the Illinois State Bar Association (ISBA). To renew your ISBA membership, please visit:  
            <a href="www.ISBA.org/membership/join">www.ISBA.org/membership/join</a>.  
         </span> -->
        </p>
        <p style="padding:10px;" class="normalParagraph">
            We appreciate the opportunity to provide you with this valuable protection and thank you for supporting ISBA Mutual Insurance Company. Please call or e-mail me at any time if you have questions about the application or your policy.
        </p>
</body>
</apex:page>